20. Risks and Mitigation
Risk	Mitigation
Project becomes too large	Finish one room end-to-end before adding optional content.
Zombie logic becomes complex	Use fixed patrol points and a small finite-state model.
Artwork takes too long	Use a consistent original 2D illustration style and reuse background elements.
Puzzle progression breaks	Use named item and puzzle IDs and test each unlock condition.
Mobile layout is difficult	Use tap hotspots, large buttons and simplified scene composition.
Game feels too scary or childish	Use goofy character design, humour and non-graphic suspense.
Campus representation is inaccurate	Use a fictionalized campus-inspired layout and avoid claiming exact mapping.

